---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<figure class="product-figure">
  <div class="product-window" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative ValariFlow workspace showing a fictional customer enquiry, conversation history and a draft reply workflow. This is a conceptual illustration, not a live product screenshot.">
    <div class="window-top"><div class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span>your business, in flow</span><span class="window-status">Demo workspace</span></div>
    <div class="workspace"><div class="workspace-sidebar"><div class="workspace-logo">V<span>f</span></div><span class="side-icon active"><Icon name="inbox" size={21}/></span><span class="side-icon"><Icon name="contacts" size={21}/></span><span class="side-icon"><Icon name="flow" size={21}/></span><span class="side-icon"><Icon name="campaign" size={21}/></span><span class="workspace-avatar">A</span></div>
    <div class="conversation-list"><div class="inbox-heading">Conversations <span>↗</span></div><div class="fake-search">⌕ &nbsp; Find a conversation</div><div class="mini-tabs"><b>All conversations</b><span>Assigned</span></div><div class="contact-row selected"><div class="avatar lavender">MK</div><div><strong>Maya Kapoor</strong><p>Do you have this in blue?</p><small>Product enquiry</small></div><span class="unread-dot"></span></div><div class="contact-row"><div class="avatar peach">RS</div><div><strong>Ravi Shah</strong><p>Thanks, that helps!</p><small>Store information</small></div></div><div class="contact-row"><div class="avatar mint">AP</div><div><strong>Anita Patel</strong><p>What time do you close?</p><small>Opening hours</small></div></div><div class="inbox-note"><Icon name="shield" size={15}/><span>A workspace for your team</span></div></div>
    <div class="conversation-panel"><div class="chat-heading"><div class="avatar lavender">MK</div><div><strong>Maya Kapoor</strong><small>Sample conversation</small></div><span class="channel-pill">WhatsApp</span></div><div class="chat-body"><span class="chat-date">Illustrative conversation</span><div class="chat-bubble incoming">Hi! I saw the new collection.<br/>Do you have this in blue?<small>10:24</small></div><div class="chat-bubble outgoing">Hi Maya! Happy to help.<br/>Which style are you looking for?<small>Sample reply · 10:25</small></div><div class="flow-note"><span class="flow-icon"><Icon name="flow" size={17}/></span><div><strong>A thoughtful next step</strong><small>Welcome → Product question → Team</small></div><span class="draft-pill">Draft</span></div></div><div class="reply-box">Your next helpful reply… <span>↑</span></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption><span class="tiny-dot"></span> Conceptual interface illustration · fictional data · not a live screenshot</figcaption>
</figure>
